from root_resilience_author import *
U=[]
U.append(unit('網路拓樸與守恆殘差~Network topology and balance residuals',
'數位孿生必須先知道每支感測器、管段與水池代表哪個物理物件，才能比較預測與觀測。節點流量依統一方向列入守恆式，蓄水變化另作一項，而不是把所有正值直接相加。水量殘差可能來自漏列支管、時間錯位、儀表偏移或真正漏水，因此單一殘差不能唯一辨識原因。建立穩定的資產識別碼與版本化連線表，能讓一次閥門改接與一次感測器更換在資料中保持可追溯，也能避免外觀相同的圖示遮蔽實際已改變的水路。~A digital twin needs a physical identity for every sensor, pipe and tank before predictions can be compared with observations. Signed node flows enter a conservation equation, while changing storage remains a separate term. A residual can arise from an omitted branch, timing error, instrument bias or leakage and therefore does not identify its cause uniquely. Stable asset identifiers and versioned connections preserve the distinction between a changed water route and a replaced sensor, even when the displayed diagram looks unchanged.',
'教學假設一個無蓄水節點，兩股入流為1.8及0.6 m³/s，量得出流2.3 m³/s；殘差r=1.8+0.6−2.3=0.1 m³/s。此數值尚不能直接當作漏水量。~Assume a storage-free teaching node with inflows 1.8 and 0.6 m³/s and measured outflow 2.3 m³/s. Residual r=1.8+0.6−2.3=0.1 m³/s is not automatically a leakage estimate.',
'逐一核對資產編號、流向符號、旁通管與量測時間，再以獨立水量計或水池水位變化驗算。把改接前後的拓樸版本分開重播，觀察殘差是持續偏移還是只在切換期間出現，並保留校正紀錄以區分資料錯誤與真實水量缺口。~Check asset identifiers, signs, bypasses and timestamps before using an independent meter or tank-level change to test balance. Replay topology versions separately and distinguish a persistent residual from a switching transient, retaining calibration records as evidence for competing explanations.',
'若旁通支管未納入模型，校正程序可能錯把少算的流量吸收到需求係數中。這會使平時殘差看似降低，卻在閥門切換後產生更大的偏差，不能用較小的訓練誤差證明拓樸正確。~An omitted bypass may be absorbed into calibrated demand coefficients. Training residuals then decrease while errors grow after valve changes, so a better fitted baseline does not demonstrate correct network connectivity.',
'節點出現正水量殘差，就一定代表同等流量的管線漏水。~A positive node balance residual always equals the physical leakage flow.',
'繪出包含旁通管的四節點示意圖，先以正負號重算每點守恆，再故意漏列一段水路。比較所有節點殘差的空間分布，提出一項能區分漏列支管與儀表固定偏移的額外量測。~Draw a four-node network with a bypass and calculate each signed balance. Omit one connection deliberately, compare the spatial residual pattern, and propose an additional measurement distinguishing that omission from fixed meter bias.'))
U.append(unit('時間同步與相位誤差~Time alignment and phase error',
'水位與流量紀錄常來自不同時鐘，資料到達伺服器的時間也可能晚於實際取樣。若直接以接收時間配對，正常的水力傳播便可能被誤認為設備故障。週期性訊號的固定時間差可換算成相位差，但只有在週期穩定時才有這種簡單關係；泵浦啟停的非週期事件要用事件時間和因果順序判讀。重採樣之前應保留原始時間戳、時區、品質旗標與取樣間隔，不能先把缺值平滑後再假設兩條曲線已同步。~Water levels and flows often come from different clocks, and arrival at a server can lag physical sampling. Pairing records by reception time may turn normal propagation into an apparent fault. A fixed delay maps to phase for a stable periodic signal, whereas irregular pump events require explicit event times and causal ordering. Preserve original timestamps, time zones, quality flags and sampling intervals before resampling; smoothing missing values does not establish synchronization between two records.',
'教學假設穩定週期T=900 s的水位振盪，一個通道晚記60 s；相位誤差φ=360×60/900=24°。此值不代表水在兩測站間真的旅行60 s。~Assume a steady water-level period T=900 s and a channel timestamp delayed 60 s. Phase error φ=360×60/900=24°. This does not establish a physical travel time between stations.',
'以共同事件或獨立時鐘記錄檢查相對延遲，將取樣時間與接收時間分開繪圖。再測試延遲是否隨通訊負載變動；只有在時間校正可重現且不會倒置事件順序時，才比較模型的水力相位，並記錄重採樣所使用的方法。~Check relative delay against a common event or independent clock, plotting sample and reception times separately. Test variation with communication load. Compare hydraulic phase only after reproducible time correction, preserving event order and documenting the resampling method used.',
'自動移動曲線以追求最高相關係數，可能把真實水力延遲一併消掉。若對所有通道套用同一補值規則，還可能製造本來不存在的同步尖峰，使異常分類器學到資料處理的痕跡。~Shifting curves to maximize correlation can remove genuine hydraulic delay. Applying one filling rule to every channel can also manufacture synchronized peaks, allowing an anomaly classifier to learn processing artifacts instead of physical behavior.',
'只要兩條曲線的相關係數最高，就證明兩個感測器已正確同步。~Maximum correlation between two curves proves that their sensors are correctly synchronized.',
'建立一條十五分鐘週期的合成曲線與一條延後一分鐘的副本，再加入一次真正的水力延遲。分別標記時鐘偏移與傳播時間，說明僅靠相關係數為何無法辨認兩者，並寫出必要的獨立時間證據。~Create a fifteen-minute synthetic cycle and a copy delayed one minute, then add genuine propagation delay. Label clock offset separately and explain why correlation alone cannot distinguish the causes, specifying the independent timing evidence required.'))
U.append(unit('單位、基準面與壓力水頭~Units, datums and pressure head',
'數位孿生交換資料時，壓力、壓力水頭與總水頭必須明確區分。相同壓力讀值裝在不同高程，代表的測壓管水頭並不相同；若使用總能量水頭，還要說明速度水頭是否納入。感測器可能回報表壓或絕對壓力，地形資料也可能使用不同垂直基準面，因此欄位名稱相同仍不足以證明可以相減。將量綱、密度假設、垂直基準與感測器取壓位置一起版本化，才有可能在設備更換後重現同一個物理判讀。~Data exchange must distinguish pressure, pressure head and total head. Equal pressure readings at different elevations do not imply equal piezometric head; total energy head also requires a stated velocity contribution. Instruments may report gauge or absolute pressure, while terrain records may use different vertical datums. Matching column names are therefore insufficient. Version the units, assumed density, elevation datum and pressure-tap position together so that replacing an instrument does not silently change the physical interpretation.',
'教學假設淡水ρ=1000 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²，表壓水頭40 m與取壓點高程25 m；表壓p=392.4 kPa，測壓管水頭H=25+40=65 m，未含速度水頭。~Assume freshwater density 1000 kg/m³, g=9.81 m/s², gauge pressure head 40 m and tap elevation 25 m. Gauge pressure is 392.4 kPa and piezometric head H=65 m, excluding velocity head.',
'先用一筆可手算的固定數值逐層通過資料介面，確認公斤帕與帕的倍率以及公尺的垂直基準。將感測器零點、取壓口高程和大氣壓處理方式列入資料字典，再對照獨立水準測量，不以圖上的數字相近作為基準一致的證據。~Pass one hand-checkable value through every interface to verify pressure scaling and elevation datum. Document instrument zero, tap elevation and atmospheric-pressure treatment, then compare an independent level survey instead of treating similar displayed numbers as evidence of datum consistency.',
'若模型把絕對壓力當成表壓，會加入一個近似大氣壓的假水頭；若又用需求校正抵消此差，模型可能在另一海拔或天氣條件下失準。單位錯誤不應交給參數最佳化掩蓋。~Treating absolute pressure as gauge pressure introduces a spurious atmospheric head. Calibration may conceal it temporarily, then fail at another elevation or atmospheric condition; parameter optimization should not mask unit or datum errors.',
'兩支壓力計讀值相同，就表示它們所在位置的總水頭必定相同。~Equal pressure readings always imply equal total hydraulic head at both locations.',
'建立表壓、絕對壓力、壓力水頭與測壓管水頭四欄對照表，逐欄標出單位與基準。故意將其中一欄改成千帕，設計一個能在資料進入模型前即拒絕錯誤倍率的檢核條件。~Build a table separating gauge pressure, absolute pressure, pressure head and piezometric head with units and datums. Change one column to kilopascals and design a validation rule that rejects incorrect scaling before model ingestion.'))
U.append(unit('獨立感測器的加權融合~Weighted fusion of independent sensors',
'兩支感測器估計同一個量時，若誤差無偏、互相獨立而且變異數已知，可使用反變異數加權得到較小的不確定度。權重不是儀器價格、顯示小數位數或資料筆數的替代說法，而是對誤差模型的明確假設。兩支儀器若共用取壓管、供電或校正來源，可能具有共同偏差，此時獨立公式會過度樂觀。融合之前要確認兩者真的觀察同一物理狀態，同時保留各自原始值，才能在融合結果看似平穩時發現單一通道漂移。~For two estimates of the same quantity, inverse-variance weighting reduces uncertainty when errors are unbiased, independent and have known variances. Weight is not a proxy for instrument price, displayed precision or record count. Shared pressure lines, power supplies or calibration references can introduce common bias, making the independence formula optimistic. Confirm that both instruments observe the same physical state and preserve their separate records so that a stable fused estimate does not conceal one drifting channel.',
'教學假設兩個獨立無偏水頭估計40±2 m與46±1 m，其中±為標準不確定度；融合值=(40/4+46/1)/(1/4+1)=44.8 m，標準不確定度√(1/1.25)=0.8944 m。~Assume independent unbiased head estimates 40±2 m and 46±1 m, with standard uncertainties. The fused estimate is (40/4+46)/(1/4+1)=44.8 m, with standard uncertainty √(1/1.25)=0.8944 m.',
'先檢查校正與安裝是否提供獨立性證據，再用並行資料估計殘差相關性。以已知參考值分別評估兩支感測器的偏差，並比較融合前後的區間涵蓋率；若共同誤差存在，應在協方差中明列，而非再加入第三支相同來源儀器就宣稱問題解決。~Check calibration and installation evidence for independence, then estimate residual correlation. Compare each sensor with an external reference and evaluate interval coverage before and after fusion. Represent shared error in covariance instead of assuming another similarly sourced sensor eliminates the problem.',
'若把重複上傳的同一筆量測視為多支獨立感測器，計算會顯示不確定度不斷下降，實際資訊卻沒有增加。共用錯誤基準的儀器也可能彼此吻合而一起偏離真值，因此一致性不等於準確性。~Counting repeated uploads as independent sensors artificially reduces calculated uncertainty without adding information. Instruments sharing an incorrect reference can agree closely while all departing from the true value, so agreement is not equivalent to accuracy.',
'把同一支感測器的資料複製十份再平均，就能得到十支獨立儀器的準確度。~Copying one sensor record ten times provides the accuracy of ten independent instruments.',
'重算兩支感測器等權平均與反變異數平均，說明結果為何偏向較小變異數者。再替兩者加入相同的三公尺偏移，觀察融合值與原公式不確定度的變化，指出原先獨立無偏假設何處失效。~Compare equal-weight and inverse-variance estimates, then add the same three-metre bias to both sensors. Recompute the fused value and nominal uncertainty, explaining which independence or unbiasedness assumptions no longer describe the changed data.'))
U.append(unit('參數可辨識性與校正實驗~Parameter identifiability and calibration experiments',
'模型參數能被最佳化程式找到一組數值，不代表資料足以唯一辨識它們。不同粗糙度、需求分配或感測器偏差可能形成相似的壓力殘差，讓多組參數都看似符合觀測。局部敏感度矩陣的獨立欄位代表不同參數會留下可分辨的影響；若欄位近乎平行，量測噪音就會造成巨大的參數變動。校正實驗應改變可控制的工況或增加不同位置量測，並保留參數合理範圍，不能只靠增加同一工況的重複資料期待問題自動消失。~Finding a parameter vector does not mean observations identify it uniquely. Roughness, demand distribution and sensor bias can produce similar pressure residuals, allowing many apparently successful fits. Independent columns of a local sensitivity matrix indicate distinguishable parameter effects; nearly parallel columns amplify observation noise into large parameter changes. Calibration should introduce different operating conditions or observation locations and retain plausible parameter ranges, rather than expecting repeated measurements under one unchanged condition to resolve the ambiguity.',
'教學線性模型以無因次參數r與d表示，只有r+d=8時，(3,5)與(4,4)都符合。增加獨立觀測r+2d=13後，矩陣行列式為1，解得r=3、d=5；此僅為可辨識性示例。~In a dimensionless teaching model, r+d=8 admits both (3,5) and (4,4). Adding r+2d=13 gives matrix determinant 1 and identifies r=3, d=5; this is an identifiability example, not a field calibration.',
'以多組起始參數重跑校正，檢查是否得到相似誤差卻不同的參數。列出敏感度矩陣及其尺度，測試新增量測能否提供不同方向的資訊，再用未參與校正的工況驗證；即使矩陣可逆，也應分析量測噪音對解的放大程度。~Repeat calibration from several initial values and look for similar residuals with different parameters. Inspect scaled sensitivities, test whether added measurements provide independent information, and validate under held-out conditions. Invertibility alone does not establish acceptable sensitivity to measurement noise.',
'強制最佳化器輸出唯一結果，可能只是演算法選了眾多等價解之一。若參數走到邊界卻仍有系統殘差，應先檢查模型結構與資料偏差，而非擴大到不合理的物理範圍繼續追求低誤差。~A unique optimizer output may merely select one of many equivalent solutions. Parameters stuck at bounds with systematic residuals should trigger checks of model structure and data bias, rather than unrestricted expansion into physically implausible ranges.',
'最佳化程式只回傳一組參數，就證明這組參數已被資料唯一辨識。~A single parameter vector returned by an optimizer proves unique identification by the data.',
'畫出兩條教學線性觀測方程的交點，再把第二條改為2r+2d=16。比較新增資料前後的解集合，說明多一條方程為何不一定多一項獨立資訊，並提出不同工況下的第三個觀測構想。~Plot the two teaching equations, then replace the second with 2r+2d=16. Compare solution sets and explain why another equation may add no independent information, proposing a third observation under a genuinely different condition.'))
U.append(unit('時間步長與數值守恆~Time steps and numerical conservation',
'動態水量模型將連續的入流與出流積分成蓄水變化，有限時間步長會引入離散誤差。若入流在步內快速增加，使用步首值會低估水量；縮短步長通常有助於比較收斂，但不能修正漏掉的水路或錯誤的邊界。模型驗證需分清楚程式是否解對所選方程，以及方程是否描述真實設備。對已知解析解的合成案例先做數值驗證，再以不同步長比較水量閉合，可避免把演算法誤差當成需要重新校正的水力參數。~A dynamic balance integrates changing inflow and outflow into storage, and finite time steps introduce discretization error. Using the initial inflow underestimates volume during a rising interval. Smaller steps support convergence checks but cannot repair omitted pathways or wrong boundaries. Distinguish solving the chosen equations correctly from choosing equations that describe the plant. Start with synthetic cases having analytical solutions, then compare balance closure across time steps so that numerical error is not absorbed into calibrated hydraulic parameters.',
'教學假設60 s內入流Q(t)=10+0.1t m³/s且無出流；解析入流量為10×60+0.5×0.1×60²=780 m³。單步左矩形法只有600 m³，少算180 m³。~Assume Q(t)=10+0.1t m³/s for 60 s with no outflow. Exact volume is 780 m³. One initial-value rectangular step gives 600 m³, underestimating volume by 180 m³.',
'保留相同物理參數，分別用六十秒、三十秒與十五秒步長重算，與解析積分比較而不是只互相比較。記錄每步蓄水與入出流的守恆差，並檢查事件是否落在步長邊界；對沒有解析解的案例，仍須建立網格或步長收斂證據。~Keep physical parameters fixed and compare sixty-, thirty- and fifteen-second calculations against the analytical integral. Record interval balance residuals and event alignment. When an analytical solution is unavailable, still establish step-size convergence rather than accepting agreement between two coarse simulations.',
'若直接調整入流係數補償過粗步長，校正值會隨時間解析度改變，失去可轉移性。單一時間點的水位吻合也可能掩蓋期間水量誤差，因此驗證應同時檢查軌跡與累積量。~Adjusting inflow coefficients to compensate for coarse integration makes calibration depend on time resolution. Agreement at one water level can conceal interval volume error, so validation should examine both the trajectory and accumulated quantities.',
'把水力參數重新校正到量測曲線，就一定能消除任何時間步長造成的數值誤差。~Recalibrating hydraulic parameters always eliminates numerical error caused by the chosen time step.',
'手算三十秒與十五秒左矩形法的總入流量，畫出誤差隨步長縮小的變化。再用梯形法處理相同線性入流，說明它為何在此特例得到解析值，但不保證對所有快速變化訊號都無誤差。~Calculate thirty- and fifteen-second left-rectangle totals and plot error against step size. Apply the trapezoidal rule to the same linear inflow, explaining why it is exact here without implying exactness for arbitrary rapidly changing signals.'))
U.append(unit('保留驗證資料與殘差指標~Held-out validation and residual metrics',
'校正資料與驗證資料的分離，是判斷數位孿生能否描述未見工況的重要步驟。平均誤差反映整體偏移，均方根誤差則同時包含偏差與離散程度；正負誤差抵消後的零平均值，不代表預測逐點正確。時間序列若相鄰樣本高度相關，隨機切分會把幾乎相同的事件放進兩邊，使表現過度樂觀。應依完整事件、季節或設備工況分組留出資料，再同時檢查尖峰、低流量與狀態切換的殘差分布，而不只報告一個平均分數。~Separating calibration and validation data tests whether a twin represents unseen conditions. Mean error describes overall bias, while root-mean-square error includes both bias and scatter; cancelling positive and negative errors does not imply pointwise accuracy. Randomly splitting highly correlated time samples can place nearly identical events in both sets. Hold out complete events, seasons or operating states, and examine peak, low-flow and switching residuals separately instead of reporting only one averaged score.',
'教學假設四個保留樣本的水頭殘差為1、−1、2、−2 m；平均偏差為0 m，但RMSE=√((1²+1²+2²+2²)/4)=1.581 m。此結果僅描述這四筆資料。~Assume held-out head residuals of 1, −1, 2 and −2 m. Mean bias is zero, but RMSE=√((1+1+4+4)/4)=1.581 m. These metrics describe only the four stated samples.',
'在校正前決定資料分組與驗證指標，避免看過答案才挑選容易的測試區段。對每個保留事件列出偏差、均方根誤差與最大絕對誤差，並檢查品質旗標及缺值比例；將模型不適用的工況明列，不能直接刪去表現差的資料。~Define data groups and metrics before calibration. For each held-out event, report bias, RMSE and maximum absolute error while checking quality flags and missingness. Identify unsupported operating conditions explicitly instead of removing difficult records after inspecting model performance.',
'若在驗證資料上反覆選參數，該資料就已參與模型選擇，不再是獨立檢驗。將大量平穩時段混入短暫失準事件，也會壓低總體平均誤差，使真正影響決策的少數失敗被稀釋。~Repeated parameter selection on validation records makes them part of model development. Large amounts of quiet operation can also dilute short but consequential failures, lowering an overall average while leaving decision-relevant errors unresolved.',
'驗證殘差的平均值是零，就表示模型的每一個預測值都完全準確。~A zero mean validation residual means every individual model prediction is exact.',
'分別計算四筆殘差的平均絕對誤差與最大絕對誤差，與均方根誤差比較。再加入大量零殘差樣本，觀察平均指標如何下降，並說明為何尖峰誤差與原本兩公尺的失準並未因此改善。~Compute mean absolute and maximum absolute error for the four residuals and compare RMSE. Add many zero residuals, observe the averaged metrics decrease, and explain why the original two-metre failures have not improved.'))
U.append(unit('狀態估計與資料同化~State estimation and data assimilation',
'資料同化利用新觀測修正模型內部狀態，並依預測與量測不確定度決定修正幅度。最簡單的純量卡爾曼更新假設線性、無偏且誤差獨立；水池高度可以作為狀態，但實際系統還可能需要需求量、流量與感測器偏移等多個狀態。更新後的不確定度變小，只表示在既定統計模型下資訊增加，不保證物理方程正確。若資料被重複使用或誤差相關性未處理，估計器可能顯示非常自信，卻無法預測下一個真實事件。~Assimilation updates internal model states using new observations, with the correction governed by prediction and measurement uncertainty. A scalar Kalman update assumes linearity, unbiased independent errors and known variances. Tank level can be a state, although real systems may also require demand, flow and sensor-bias states. Reduced variance means added information within that statistical model, not proof of correct physics. Reused observations or ignored correlations can produce an overconfident estimate that fails on the next event.',
'教學純量案例：預測水位10 m、預測變異數4 m²，觀測14 m、量測變異數1 m²；K=4/(4+1)=0.8，更新水位10+0.8×4=13.2 m，更新變異數0.8 m²。~For a scalar teaching case, predicted level is 10 m with variance 4 m²; observation is 14 m with variance 1 m². Gain K=0.8 gives updated level 13.2 m and variance 0.8 m².',
'先核對變異數與標準差沒有混用，再以獨立合成訊號測試更新公式。記錄更新前的創新量與其預測變異數，檢查它是否長期偏離零或呈連續相關；若持續出現同方向偏差，應評估模型或感測器偏移，而不是無限制調大增益。~Check that variances are not confused with standard deviations, then test the update on independent synthetic signals. Record innovations and predicted innovation variance, examining persistent bias and serial correlation before attributing improvement to a larger gain or more frequent updates.',
'同一觀測若在一次更新後又當作新資料重複加入，會讓變異數不合理地縮小。若更新後水位超出物理幾何範圍，簡單截斷也會改變統計分布，必須明確記錄約束處理方式。~Reusing the same observation as new evidence shrinks variance incorrectly. Clipping updated levels to physical bounds also changes their statistical distribution and must be documented as a constraint treatment, not presented as an unchanged unconstrained update.',
'資料同化後的不確定度下降，就能證明原本的物理模型完全正確。~Reduced uncertainty after assimilation proves that the underlying physical model is completely correct.',
'把量測變異數從一平方公尺改為九平方公尺，重算增益、更新水位與變異數，說明結果為何更靠近模型預測。再分析同一量測被錯誤重複同化時，估計器會出現哪一種虛假的信心。~Change measurement variance from one to nine square metres and recompute gain, level and variance. Explain the increased weight on the prediction, then analyze the false confidence caused by assimilating the same measurement repeatedly.'))
U.append(unit('異常警報與基準發生率~Anomaly alerts and base rates',
'異常偵測器的真陽性率與偽陽性率描述不同條件下的分類表現，不能直接解讀成一次警報為真的機率。當實際異常很少，正常情況的少量誤報也可能超過真正事件。評估時必須定義事件的時間窗口、持續條件與標記來源，避免把連續一百筆同一事故當成一百次獨立成功。警報應附帶可檢查的殘差、感測品質與相似事件證據，並在資料分布變動時重新評估，不能因為模型輸出一個高分就省略人工判讀。~True-positive and false-positive rates condition on different underlying states and do not directly give the probability that an alert is genuine. When anomalies are rare, false alerts from normal conditions can outnumber real events. Define event windows, persistence and labeling evidence, avoiding treatment of repeated samples from one incident as independent successes. Alerts should expose inspectable residuals and data quality, and performance should be reevaluated after distribution changes rather than replacing review with a high model score.',
'教學假設事件基準率0.001、真陽性率0.95、偽陽性率0.01；警報為真機率=0.95×0.001/(0.95×0.001+0.01×0.999)=8.68%，假設這些比例適用於同一母體。~Assume event prevalence 0.001, true-positive rate 0.95 and false-positive rate 0.01. Alert precision is 0.00095/(0.00095+0.00999)=8.68%, provided all rates apply to the same population.',
'使用包含正常時段的獨立事件集建立混淆矩陣，列出每種工況的事件基準率。將警報合併規則與人工複核結果保留，分開計算事件層級與樣本層級指標，並追蹤漏報及誤報的後續處置，不能只蒐集成功警報作成績單。~Build confusion matrices from independent event sets including normal operation, with prevalence by operating state. Preserve alert-grouping rules and reviewed outcomes, separating event-level from sample-level metrics and tracking missed incidents as well as false alarms instead of collecting only successful alerts.',
'若只在預先挑選的異常樣本上展示高命中率，就無法知道正常運轉會產生多少誤報。模型上線後需求型態或儀器更換也可能改變基準率與誤差分布，使過去的警報可信度不再適用。~High hit rates on preselected abnormal records say nothing about false alerts during normal operation. Changing demand patterns or instruments can alter prevalence and error distributions, invalidating a previously measured alert precision.',
'偵測器的真陽性率是百分之九十五，就表示每次警報都有百分之九十五機率是真的。~A ninety-five-percent true-positive rate means every alert has a ninety-five-percent chance of being genuine.',
'以十萬個獨立教學事件建表，計算預期真警報與假警報數量。再把基準率提高十倍而保持兩種分類率不變，重算警報可信度，說明相同分類器為何會在不同母體呈現不同的使用價值。~Tabulate expected true and false alerts across one hundred thousand independent teaching events. Increase prevalence tenfold while holding classification rates fixed, then recompute precision and explain why the same classifier has different practical value in another population.'))
U.append(unit('情境比較與可追溯決策~Scenario comparison and traceable decisions',
'數位孿生的情境比較應固定需求、邊界及評估期間，才能把節能差異歸因於所比較的策略。單位供水能耗只是其中一項指標，仍需同時滿足水位、水壓、水質與設備限制；較低能耗若伴隨供水不足，不能視為等效服務下的改善。每次分析應保存模型版本、資料時間範圍、參數、假設和人工審查結果，使未來能重播同一情境。生成式助教可協助整理證據與解釋差異，但其文字結論不能代替可執行模型輸出或現場授權程序。~Scenario comparison holds demand, boundaries and assessment duration fixed so that energy differences can be attributed to the proposed strategy. Specific energy is only one metric alongside level, pressure, quality and equipment constraints; lower energy with unmet demand is not equivalent service improvement. Preserve model version, data period, parameters, assumptions and reviewed conclusions for reproducible replay. A generative tutor can organize evidence and explain differences, but its prose does not replace executable model results or authorized operating procedures.',
'教學假設兩方案均供水1000 m³且均滿足相同限制，耗能分別200與180 kWh；單位能耗0.20與0.18 kWh/m³，節能率(200−180)/200=10%，未含價格差與設備磨耗。~Assume both strategies supply 1000 m³ and satisfy identical constraints, using 200 and 180 kWh. Specific energy is 0.20 and 0.18 kWh/m³, a 10% reduction excluding tariff differences and equipment wear.',
'先對照兩方案的供水量、服務品質與邊界條件，再檢查能耗計算是否包含同一組設備。用資料與模型雜湊記錄可重播版本，另列需求及參數敏感度，最後把待現場驗證的假設與已被量測支持的結論分開，避免把模擬排名直接當成操作命令。~Compare supplied volume, service quality and boundaries before checking that energy includes the same equipment. Record replayable data and model hashes, evaluate demand sensitivity, and separate assumptions needing field confirmation from supported conclusions before converting a scenario ranking into an operational decision.',
'若兩方案使用不同需求總量或電價期間，較低帳單不必然表示較高能源效率。缺少版本與輸入紀錄的漂亮圖表也無法重現，因此不能在條件已改變後沿用舊排名而不重新計算。~Different demands or tariff periods make lower cost an unreliable indicator of greater energy efficiency. Attractive plots without versioned inputs cannot be reproduced, and old rankings should not be reused after conditions change without recalculation.',
'只要數位孿生預測某方案耗能較低，就可以忽略供水限制直接執行。~Any strategy predicted to use less energy can be implemented without checking water-service constraints.',
'建立兩方案比較表，包含供水量、能耗、單位能耗及限制是否滿足，再把其中一方案供水量減少一成。重算指標並說明為何原先節能結論需要重新判讀，最後列出第三人重播分析所需的最小檔案清單。~Compare volume, energy, specific energy and constraint compliance, then reduce the delivery of one strategy by ten percent. Recalculate and reconsider the claimed improvement, listing the minimum files another reviewer needs to reproduce the analysis.'))
EP=source('epa-epanet-model','美國環保署 EPANET 模型與文件','EPA EPANET model and documentation','US EPA','https://www.epa.gov/water-research/epanet','配水模型、即時資料延伸及2020年版本日期；不是水再生廠專屬模擬器。','Distribution modeling, real-time extension and 2020 release dates; not a plant-specific reclamation simulator.')
NI=source('nist-digital-twin-credibility','數位孿生可信度研究','Credibility consideration for digital twins in manufacturing','NIST','https://www.nist.gov/publications/credibility-consideration-digital-twins-manufacturing','2022年研究的驗證與不確定度觀點；製造研究提供方法比較，不宣稱為水務強制規範。','2022 research on verification, validation and uncertainty; methodological comparison from manufacturing, not a mandatory water standard.')
PU=source('pub-changi-twin-2022','樟宜數位孿生與水務創新獎官方紀錄','PUB official account of Changi digital twin and innovation awards','PUB Singapore','https://www.pub.gov.sg/Resources/News-Room/PressReleases/2022/09/PUB-projects-bag-triple-gold-at-International-Water-Association','樟宜數位孿生2019年合作與2022年獲獎；濱海東海淡廠僅作不同流程的比較地標。','Changi partnership in 2019 and 2022 award; Marina East is a comparison of a different treatment process, not a claimed twin deployment.')
save('b300',focus='守恆、時間同步、狀態估計與可重現決策~Conservation, time alignment, state estimation and reproducible decisions',summary='以樟宜水再生廠數位孿生為真實入口，逐步建立從感測資料到決策證據的完整鏈結。十個單元分辨拓樸、時鐘、單位、校正與異常判讀的錯誤來源，並以原創小型算例驗證每項假設。課程把模型驗證與真實設備確認分開，讓學徒能指出預測可信的條件及仍需量測的疑問。~Starting from the real Changi Water Reclamation Plant digital twin, build a chain from sensor records to decision evidence. Ten units distinguish topology, timing, units, calibration and anomaly interpretation through original numerical examples. Separate equation verification from physical validation and identify both the conditions supporting a prediction and questions requiring additional observations.',history='樟宜水再生廠的數位孿生合作在官方紀錄中始於2019年，並在2022年獲得國際水協會創新獎。配水系統的EPANET與製造領域的數位孿生可信度研究，提供不同模型範圍的比較入口。本課不把一套管網工具當作整座處理廠的完整替代，也不宣稱另一座獲獎海淡廠採用相同平台。學習重點是明確定義模型用途、資料交換與驗證證據，將真實工程背景和獨立的教學假設區分。~PUB records the Changi digital-twin collaboration from 2019 and an international innovation award in 2022. Distribution-network modeling and manufacturing credibility research provide comparisons across different model scopes. This course does not equate a pipe-network tool with a complete treatment-plant simulator or claim that another award-winning desalination plant uses the same platform. The learning goal is to define purpose, information exchange and validation evidence while separating documented history from independently assumed teaching models.',example='教學比較採用兩個不同的資料品質問題。首先，兩支獨立無偏水頭感測器分別為40±2 m與46±1 m，反變異數加權得到44.8 m；若兩者共同偏高3 m，融合結果也偏高3 m，原本較小的不確定度不能揭露共同偏差。其次，取壓點高程25 m與表壓水頭40 m相加得到65 m測壓管水頭。這兩個案例不互相交換數字，因為前者討論同一狀態的統計融合，後者討論單位和垂直基準。請分別保存原始讀值、假設與計算式，再說明增加哪一項獨立量測才能區分儀器偏差與模型誤差。~Compare two distinct data-quality problems. Independent unbiased head measurements of 40±2 m and 46±1 m combine to 44.8 m by inverse-variance weighting. Adding a shared three-metre bias shifts that result by three metres; the nominal reduction in uncertainty does not expose common bias. Separately, a tap elevation of 25 m plus gauge pressure head 40 m yields piezometric head 65 m. Do not exchange numbers between these examples: one concerns statistical fusion of the same state, the other concerns units and vertical datum. Preserve raw values, assumptions and equations, then identify additional independent evidence needed to separate instrument bias from model error.',units=U,
facts=['本課10個單元各有獨立算例與可追溯假設。~10 units each contain a separate teaching model and traceable assumptions.','教學節點守恆殘差0.1 m³/s尚未辨識漏水原因。~The teaching residual of 0.1 m³/s does not identify its cause.','教學時鐘偏移60 s造成24°週期相位誤差。~A teaching clock offset of 60 s produces a 24-degree phase error.','教學水頭融合值44.8 m依賴獨立無偏誤差假設。~The teaching fused head of 44.8 m assumes independent unbiased errors.','教學驗證資料平均偏差0 m但均方根誤差1.581 m。~Teaching validation bias is zero while RMSE is 1.581 m.','教學情境節能10%以前提服務量與限制相同為條件。~The teaching energy reduction of 10% assumes equivalent service and constraints.'],
timeline=[{'year':'2019','event':'官方紀錄記載樟宜水再生廠數位孿生合作開始。~PUB records the start of the Changi reclamation-plant digital-twin collaboration.'},{'year':'2020','event':'美國環保署公布EPANET第二點二版配水模擬工具。~EPA publishes release two point two of its distribution-network modeling tool.'},{'year':'2022','event':'樟宜數位孿生專案取得國際水協會創新類金獎。~The Changi digital-twin project receives an International Water Association innovation gold award.'}],
codes=['EPANET 2.2使用者手冊：配水網路建模範圍。~EPANET 2.2 User Manual: distribution-network modeling scope.','NIST 2022數位孿生可信度研究：方法參考，非水務法規。~NIST 2022 digital-twin credibility study: methodological reference, not water regulation.'],landmarks=['樟宜水再生廠數位孿生~Changi Water Reclamation Plant digital twin','濱海東海水淡化廠（流程比較）~Keppel Marina East Desalination Plant (process comparison)'],place=dict(name='新加坡樟宜地區（概略定位）~Changi district, Singapore (approximate location)',country='新加坡~Singapore',lat=1.32,lng=104.00,query='Changi Water Reclamation Plant Singapore'),sources=[EP,NI,PU],vendors=[entity('新加坡公用事業局','PUB Singapore','https://www.pub.gov.sg/','水資源與公共供水管理','Water-resource and public-supply management','官方樟宜數位孿生案例的水務機關','Water agency reporting the Changi digital-twin case'),entity('美國國家標準與技術研究院','NIST','https://www.nist.gov/','量測科學與可信度研究','Measurement science and credibility research','本課驗證方法的研究來源，非樟宜設備承包商','Research source for validation methods, not a Changi equipment contractor')],related=['b268','b299'],architectureNodes=[['感測資料與物件身分','Sensor data and asset identity'],['時間、單位與品質','Time, units and quality'],['守恆與可辨識模型','Conservation and identifiable models'],['獨立驗證與同化','Independent validation and assimilation'],['情境證據與審查','Scenario evidence and review']],architectureEdges=[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[3,1]])
audit('b300',[('1.8+.6-2.3',.1,1e-9),('360*60/900',24,1e-9),('25+40',65,1e-9),('(40/4+46)/(1/4+1)',44.8,1e-9),('13-8',5,1e-9),('10*60+.5*.1*60**2',780,1e-9),('math.sqrt(10/4)',1.581,.0005),('10+4/(4+1)*(14-10)',13.2,1e-9),('.95*.001/(.95*.001+.01*.999)*100',8.68,.005),('(200-180)/200*100',10,1e-9)])
